      <description><![CDATA[<html><head><style>body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:16px;color:#1d1d1f;background:transparent;}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f5f5f7;}}h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 10px;}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;}li{margin-bottom:4px;}p{margin:0 0 8px;}</style></head><body><h3>What&#8217;s New in 0.1.5</h3>
<h3>0.1.5</h3>
<ul>
<li>Test Connection button on stdio servers — verifies reachability and shows elapsed time and tool count</li>
<li>Delete Server option in the Edit Server view with confirmation dialog</li>
<li>Server key is now auto-generated as a full slug from the display name; conflict detection prevents duplicate keys</li>
<li>Edit Server form redesigned with labeled, bordered fields so editable areas are obvious</li>
<li>Fixed About window appearing on launch</li>
<li>Fixed Sparkle update relaunch after install</li>
</ul>
<h3>0.1.4</h3>
<ul>
<li>New app icon with custom artwork — detailed at large sizes, clean silhouette at small sizes</li>
<li>About panel with Evil Inc. cityscape background and frosted glass design</li>
